<title>UK: Dicharge starts on refloated Egyptian barley ship.</title>
<headline>Dicharge starts on refloated Egyptian barley ship.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discharge of the barley cargo on the refloated bulk carrier Qena has started at the Saudi Arabian port of Dammam, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Egyptian-flag 38,319-dwt Qena is being inspected to ascertain the nature and extent of any damage.</p>
</text>
